Source: lindon
Section: audio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Anjeleno <la90046@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), autotools-dev @HPKLINUX_DEP@
Standards-Version: 4.4.1

Package: lindon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, mariadb-server, mariadb-client, libqt6sql6-mysql, apache2, curl, rsyslog, python3, python3-pycurl, python3-mysqldb, python3-serial, python3-requests, icedax, xsltproc, pipewire-jack, ffmpeg, fdkaac, pipewire, wireplumber, gedit, libasound2-plugins, mp3gain, libmad0, libtwolame0
Recommends: vlc, vlc-plugin-jack
Replaces: rivolution-pypad, rivolution
Conflicts: rivolution
Description: Radio Broadcast Automation System
 lindon is a complete radio broadcast automation solution, with
 facilities for the acquisition, management, scheduling and playout of
 audio content.  Modules for the production and management of podcast
 audio are also included.

Package: lindon-importers
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, lindon (= ${binary:Version})
Replaces: rivolution-importers
Conflicts: rivolution-importers
Description: Library importers for the Rivendell Broadcast Automation System
 This package contains various importer scripts, which can be used to
 import audio from existing legacy automation systems into Rivendell.
 Currently, scripts exist for the AirForce Wings, Prophet NexGen and Sierra
 Automated Systems SASAuto systems, as well as from another Rivendell system
 (useful for 'merging' multiple databases).  Additionally, scripts for
 initializing switcher matrices for the Christian Radio Consortium
 (CRC) Unity4000 network and copying RDCatch event lists between hosts
 are included.

Package: lindon-opsguide
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Replaces: rivolution-opsguide
Conflicts: rivolution-opsguide
Description: lindon Operations and Administration Guide
 This package contains the lindon Operations and Administration Guide,
 in both HTML and PDF formats.

Package: lindon-webapi
Architecture: any
Depends:  ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Replaces: rivolution-webapi
Conflicts: rivolution-webapi
Description: Client libraries for interfacing with Rivendell's C Web API.
 This package contains client libraries for interfacing with Rivendell's
 C Web API subsystem.

Package: lindon-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, lindon-webapi (= ${binary:Version})
Replaces: rivolution-dev
Conflicts: rivolution-dev
Description: Header files and example code for development with Rivendell C API
 This package contains header files and example code for development using
 Rivendell's Web C API.

Package: lindon-select
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, lindon (= ${binary:Version})
Replaces: rivolution-select
Conflicts: rivolution-select
Description: The RDSelect system selector tool for lindon.
 This package contains the RDMonitor/RDSelect tool for lindon, which can
 be used to select which amoung multiple lindon instances a host should be
 associated with.

Package: lindon-webget
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, lindon (= ${binary:Version})
Replaces: rivolution-webget
Conflicts: rivolution-webget
Description: The WebGet audio fetcher service for lindon
 This package contains the WebGet audio fetching tool for lindon.

